# XDG global gitignore — applies to every repo on this machine.
# Personal-workflow noise that should never be committed anywhere.

# Worktrees: per the ~/dotfiles/claude/.claude/CLAUDE.md worktree workflow,
# worktrees live inside the main repo under `.claude/worktrees/` — Claude Code's
# native worktree location, so entering one fires no permission-root relocation
# prompt. Without these entries, `git status` in the main repo lists every
# worktree as untracked, and gitignore-respecting tools (rg, fd, fzf, telescope)
# walk into the (potentially multi-GB) worktree copies and show duplicate hits.
# `.worktrees/` is the pre-migration location, kept until the last old worktree
# there is removed.
**/.claude/worktrees/
.worktrees/

# Per-host Claude Code settings — never share machine-specific overrides.
**/.claude/settings.local.json
